@base = http://localhost:5104

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Known seeded attraction
GET {{base}}/api/v1/attractions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### List attractions (ordered) and search by name substring
GET {{base}}/api/v1/attractions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/attractions?name=museum

### Create an attraction; GET the returned Location to retrieve it
POST {{base}}/api/v1/attractions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Museum",
  "description": "A manually entered attraction",
  "rating": 4,
  "address": "Montreal",
  "lat": 45.5,
  "lon": -73.57,
  "estimatedVisitMinutes": 60
}

### Patch an attraction (partial fields allowed). Malformed GUID -> 400, unknown valid GUID -> 404
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/attractions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Renamed Museum"
}

### Known seeded transport entry
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transport-modes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101

### Create a transport entry; GET the returned Location
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transport-modes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "train",
  "name": "Example Train",
  "description": "Manually entered transport"
}

### Known seeded route point
GET {{base}}/api/v1/route-points/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201

### Create a reusable point; GET the returned Location
POST {{base}}/api/v1/route-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transport_stop",
  "name": "Example Station",
  "address": "Montreal",
  "lat": 45.5,
  "lon": -73.57,
  "sourceId": null
}
